  "details": "It would be fantastic if there was more ways that you could accept your position when you lock into FBT.\nThis since there are users (me included) with injuries or other problems that make it hard or impossible to press both triggers at the same time. So having the option to lock in with only one trigger would be helpful.\nAnother solution would be if we were able to remap the buttons to whatever we want. So we can lock in with the menu button instead or whatever button is easier to access.",
